 "transcript": [
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and what of it? I am a man and I will not be idle. It is well that I have some affair in the world.\"",
  "[action] (to the second son) eldest son and second son argue",
  "[action] Wang Lung sits and smokes pipe",
  "[says] Wang Lung asks his sons to tell him about the business.",
  "Wang Lung: \"Well now, tell your old father something of this matter. I do not know my sons and they do not know me, so let us talk together.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung listens",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Now this is a good thing and you are a good man to think of it.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the second son): \"Now this is a good thing and you are a good man to think of it.\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung expresses pleasure and pride in his sons.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"There is something more to it, my father,\"",
  "the second son (to Wang Lung): \"It is a new thing, a loan office. I am not to lend money, but to borrow money at the city rate and lend it here at the country rate.\"",
  "[action] Second son speaks",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Yes, and my brother is to buy up the poorer lands and my brother is to be the manager of it all.\"",
  "[silence] the second son says nothing.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"I shall have a house of my own and I shall have a wife and children.\"",
  "[action] Eldest son expresses excitement",
  "[action] Eldest son introduces wife",
  "[action] The second son introduces his wife and children.",
  "[action] The eldest son introduces his children.",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son introduces his sons."
